id: threaded-energy
name: Threaded Energy
uaType: technical
prerequisite: Energy Web Advancement
tpCost: 12
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 6
# "The Squares within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) become your Explosive Web" - applied, the Sphere said; which
# Squares, the table's. "You cannot use this Unique Ability while you possess an Explosive Web, and must pay the Ki Point
# Cost of this Unique Ability at the start of each of your turns or remove your Explosive Web. You may remove your
# Explosive Web as an Instant Maneuver" - sustained at its own KP, its row's Applied an Instant. "If an Opponent moves into
# or through these Squares, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver against them as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver ... Simple
# Profile (Energy Foundation). You can only target each Opponent with this effect once per Combat Round" - its body's
# Strike button at the token targeted (chat.mjs webStrike).
explosiveWeb: true
sustained: true
instantRelease: true
sphereMagnitude: large
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Large Sphere of Explosive Web around you, kept at its KP each turn: an Opponent moving into or through it takes a
  Simple (Energy) Basic Attack out of sequence, once each a Round.
text: >
  Threaded Energy: You can create a minefield of energy, attacking anyone within the range of energy you created.
  –Ability Type: Technical
  –Prerequisites: Energy Web Advancement
  –TP Cost: 12
  –KP Cost: 6(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: The Squares within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) become your Explosive Web. If an Opponent moves into or
  through these Squares, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver against them as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver, but the
  Attacking Maneuver must be of the Simple Profile (Energy Foundation).

  You can only target each Opponent with this effect once per Combat Round.

  You cannot use this Unique Ability while you possess an Explosive Web, and must pay the Ki Point Cost of this Unique
  Ability at the start of each of your turns or remove your Explosive Web. You may remove your Explosive Web as an Instant
  Maneuver.
